<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-REPO RATE SET AT 7.17 PCT IN AUCTION.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-REPO RATE SET AT 7.17 PCT IN AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank said on Thursday that the average rate at its 7-day repurchase auction was set at 7.15 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank offered to repurchase 4.1 million litas of securities but only 100,000 litas was taken up.</p>
<p>The settlement date for the auction is August 8 and the maturity date is August 15.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
